        "id": 8996
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-01-27T16:42:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the action of retrieving roles assigned to a user on a given domain is somehow related to the domain, the fact that the domains\u0027 fields are available through the `target.domain.*` seems fully legitimate to me. I don\u0027t think this is technically incorrect (Same reasoning for identity:create_grant).",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAUH/+YnM\u003d",
      "revId": "0496466821c1ff6e7d4209233b6c671f88aadc50",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
